- **ExperienceFirst**: experience first. The default CPU usage limit is 15%.

This parameter is required.', example='Balance'),
  priority?: int32(name='Priority', description='The policy priority. A smaller value indicates a higher priority. Valid values: 1 to 100.', example='1'),
